  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif bad genumen sy on mannes orfe for oðres mannes ðingum, ðonne begyte ða bade ham se, ðe heo fore genumen sy, oððe of his agenum ðone gehalde, ðe þæt orf age:</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a pledge of one’s cattle is taken, for another man’s cause [debt], then let him [on whose behalf the pledge was given] restore the property, or repay the amount lost by the man whose pledge was accepted [and taken].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si namum capiatur de alicuius pecunia pro alterius causa, perquirat ille namum, pro quo captum est, uel de suo proprio restituat ei, cuius pecunia capta est.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
